# ada-polycallrc - read-only Ada runtime overrides for libpolycall
#
# This file uses the SHARED polycall schema (src/config/polycall_config_schema.c).
# It introduces no new keys or parser: the Ada adapter passes this path to
# the core via the FFI boundary. Values here override polycallrc for Ada.

